ents":["branch_protection_rule","check_run","check_suite","create","delete","deployment","deployment_status","discussion","discussion_comment","fork","gollum","issues","issue_comment","label","merge_group","milestone","page_build","public","pull_request","pull_request_review","pull_request_review_comment","push","registry_package","release","repository","repository_dispatch","status","watch","workflow_dispatch","workflow_run"]},"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open5gs/open5gs/issues/comments/3649034743","html_url":"https://github.com/open5gs/open5gs/issues/4103#issuecomment-3649034743","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open5gs/open5gs/issues/4103","id":3649034743,"node_id":"IC_kwDOBM4HkM7Zf9n3","user":{"login":"acetcom","id":4222492,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQyMjI0OTI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4222492?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/acetcom","html_url":"https://github.com/acetcom","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/acetcom/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/acetcom/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/acetcom/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/acetcom/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/acetcom/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/acetcom/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/acetcom/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/acetcom/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/acetcom/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-13T06:21:52Z","updated_at":"2025-12-13T06:21:52Z","body":"@therikb31 \n\nSorry for the delayed response.\n\nTo better understand whether this issue could be related to a specific libcurl behavior, could you please let us know the curl version used on your system?\n\nYou can check it by running the following command:\n\n```\ncurl --version\n```\n\nThanks a lot!\nSukchan Lee","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open5gs/open5gs/issues/comments/3649034743/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open5gs/open5gs/issues/comments/3649132525","html_url":"https://github.com/open5gs/open5gs/issues/4103#issuecomment-3649132525","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open5gs/open5gs/issues/4103","id":3649132525,"node_id":"IC_kwDOBM4HkM7ZgVft","user":{"login":"acetcom","id":4222492,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQyMjI0OTI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4222492?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/acetcom","html_url":"https://github.com/acetcom","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/acetcom/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/acetcom/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/acetcom/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/acetcom/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/acetcom/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/acetcom/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/acetcom/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/acetcom/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/acetcom/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-13T09:00:09Z","updated_at":"2025-12-13T09:00:09Z","body":"@therikb31 \n\nWe tested this issue with curl 7.81.0 and curl 8.5.0. In both versions, after receiving an HTTP/2 GOAWAY, the client creates a new TCP connection (i.e., it does not reuse the terminated stream).\n\nThe attached PCAP was captured with curl 7.81.0, and curl 8.5.0 shows the same behavior.\n\n[goaway_7.81.pcapng.tar.gz](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/24140842/goaway_7.81.pcapng.tar.gz)\n\nIn the PCAP:\n\nAt frame 468, there is an HTTP request to the UDM.\n\nThe UDM sends GOAWAY at frame 480.\n\nThen, at frame 485, the AMF initiates a new connection and sends the next HTTP request over that new connection.\n\nIf you have any additional questions or would like us to verify specific conditions (server settings, timeouts, etc.), please let me know.\n\nThanks a lot!\nSukchan Lee","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open5gs/open5gs/issues/comments/3649132525/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open5gs/open5gs/issues/comments/3781495653","html_url":"https://github.com/open5gs/open5gs/issues/4103#issuecomment-3781495653","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open5gs/open5gs/issues/4103","id":3781495653,"node_id":"IC_kwDOBM4HkM7hZQtl","user":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/15368?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/github-actions","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","received_events_url"